      "content": "i'm trying to write a piece on the sports controversy and honestly it feels like people are just ignoring the obvious stuff. like, if we're talking about physical competition, doesn't it just make more sense to base things on biological sex? it seems like the only way to keep it fair for everyone. what do you think?",
