    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But you're saying inclusion is \"more fair,\" but aren't you ignoring the physical reality of muscle mass and bone density? if a trans woman has those biological advantages, doesn't that fundamentally undermine the fairness of the female category for biological women? it feels like you're prioritizing one group's identity over another group's actual physical safety and competitive equality. shouldn't there be a balance there?",
